     MOVE WS-D TO WS-MID
     CALL STATIC "cc_f64_sub" USING BY REFERENCE L-CZ WS-MID WS-T
     CALL STATIC "cc_f64_abs_f64" USING BY REFERENCE WS-T WS-D
     IF WS-D > WS-LIM
